_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1523406013:1":{"text":"过去、现在、未来——只要阿邦德殿下还在，领主之位就只能属于他！","source_cn":"过去、现在、未来——只要阿邦德殿下还在，领主之位就只能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F48CD3DF28A4A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1523406014:1":{"text":"你拥兵自重，张扬抗议，是因为你太狭隘，认为呼临城的食物来源只有小麦。","source_cn":"你拥兵自重，张扬抗议，是因为你太狭隘，认为呼临城的食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C2D4D7B73C34848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1523406015:1":{"text":"等到殿下寻得其他食物的那天，你演说的这些观点，便会不攻自破！","source_cn":"等到殿下寻得其他食物的那天，你演说的这些观点，便会不攻自破！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98AE01B243B6364A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1523406016:1":{"text":"食物？除了小麦，你还要从哪里寻找食物？该不会是走投无路，打算再对着丰饶堕神摇尾乞怜吧？","source_cn":"食物？除了小麦，你还要从哪里寻找食物？该不会是走投无路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B401B9587D3D9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1523406017:1":{"text":"别再做无用的挣扎了。都已经无能到要向外人求救……你所坚持的正统政权，还有什么存在的必要？它难道比呼临城的未来更重要？！","source_cn":"别再做无用的挣扎了。都已经无能到要向外人求救……你所坚...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFCA4CCB99C6DF10","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"别再做无用的挣扎了。都已经无能到要向外人求救……你所坚持的正统政权，还有什么存在的必要？它难道比呼临城的未来更重要？！","fe